The files here are the archive's xbrz.h, xbrz.cpp, xbrz_config.h,
xbrz_tools.h, License.txt and Changelog.txt, with one change, in xbrz.cpp
(blendPixel): `[&] -> bool` is `[&]() -> bool`. A lambda with a return type
and no parameter list is C++23; this project builds as C++20.

Built by the th_xbrz target (enhanced/cmake/deps.cmake) with warnings off,
outside the zero-warnings set.
